    dc:isPartOf <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/levin-2022-grn-learning-05--grok>.
<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/levin-2022-grn-learning-05--grok--data-adequacy> a <https://w3id.org/delphi/ontology/LLMClaimAssessment>;
